---
config:
  theme: neutral
  themeCSS: ".messageText, .loopText, .labelText { font-size: 22px !important; } .actor-box { font-size: 20px !important; }"
  sequence:
    actorMargin: 8
    messageMargin: 8
    mirrorActors: false
    useMaxWidth: false
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor V as VENDEDOR
    participant UI as Interface web
    participant C as Estoque<br/>Controller
    participant S as Saida<br/>Estoque
    participant DB as EstoqueContext<br/>SQLite

    V->>UI: Confirma venda
    UI->>C: POST Vender
    C->>DB: Valida SKU ativo
    C->>DB: Obtém pendência
    opt Novo atendimento
        C->>DB: SaveChanges (nova pendência)
    end
    C->>S: RegistrarVendaRapidaAsync
    S->>DB: BeginTransaction
    S->>DB: Revalida pendência
    S->>DB: UPDATE -1 se saldo >= 1
    S->>DB: SAIDA + conclui atendimento
    S->>DB: SaveChanges
    S->>DB: Commit
    S-->>C: Saldo atualizado
    C-->>UI: 200 + saldoAtual
    UI-->>V: Confirma venda
